//===- AArch64AtomicCases.def - Independently assembled LSE cases --------===//
//
// NeverD Decompiler
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
// Original instructions assembled with LLVM; production admission uses its
// own encoding families. Source/result operands use X0/X2 (pairs X0:1/X2:3),
// with X4 as the address.
